WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
Allah chose Nuh as a prophet. Nuh said, O people, worship only the One Allah!

2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:12.328
For nine hundred and fifty years, Nuh patiently called them. But they covered their ears and laughed at him.

3
00:00:12.728 --> 00:00:17.456
Allah told Nuh to build a great ship. He and his followers worked hard to build it.

4
00:00:17.856 --> 00:00:22.896
The animals boarded the Ark in pairs: elephants, lions, giraffes, and little birds.

5
00:00:23.296 --> 00:00:29.584
The flood came, with waves as tall as mountains. But the Ark sailed safely under Allah's protection.

6
00:00:29.984 --> 00:00:37.184
Nuh called to his son, My child, come aboard with us! But his son refused, and the waves swept them apart.

7
00:00:37.584 --> 00:00:44.232
The waters went down, and the Ark rested on Mount Judi. Patience and perseverance are always rewarded.
